    <h2>Reporting Software Bugs</h2>
    <p>If you encounter a mathematical error or a formatting glitch while using our utilities please include specific details in your message. Mentioning what device you are using which specific browser you are running and exactly what numbers you entered will help our engineering team replicate and destroy the bug instantly.</p>

    <h2>Response Times</h2>
    <p>Because we operate as a very small independent team we generally read all incoming messages every single morning. We actively try to reply to all important inquiries within forty eight hours during the standard business work week. We appreciate your patience while we review your suggestions.</p>
